  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Standard Bitter Love Song #1 (or 2)** (1 review): Reviewer singles it out among the set's rarer selections, alongside From TG&Y and tracks from Gothenburg [2]\n- **Golden Boy** (1 review): Reviewer is startled and delighted to hear this song included in the set [2]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Any Available Surface (?)**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Alphabetizing**: back after 28 archived shows (816 days); rare: 11 archived performances [3]\n- **Billy The Kid's Dream of the Magic Shoes**: back after 117 archived shows (4271 days); rare: 6 archived performances [3]\n- **Are you ready for some Tuning?**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Ghosts**: back after 122 archived shows (4493 days); rare: 7 archived performances [3]\n- **Hello, Old Rabbit**: back after 122 archived shows (4493 days); rare: 4 archived performances [3]\n- **Island Garden**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Jenny**: back after 24 archived shows (619 days) [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tmg2009-02-25.schoeps_cmc34_24bit** (recommended): source not stated; 28 songs; 96 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]. Said about its sound: Reviewer calls the recording's quality perfect and says the between-song banter comes through clearly [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tmg2009-02-25.schoeps_cmc34_24bit**: taped by rainingvodka; source: cmc34->aeta psp3->r-09(@24bit 48khz)->cool edit pro->cdwav->flac frontend [1]",
